"""The wasi demo: a Flutter app whose Rust bridge needs a working `std`.

Separate from e2e/flutter_demo on purpose: folding this crate's uuid-and-clock
members into that app's bridge would move it off plain
`wasm32-unknown-unknown`, which is the platform it exists to cover.
"""

